---
// One idea of a lesson: the question as a ## heading and a few sentences on the left, the explainer that carries the
// idea on the right (it stays in view while the text scrolls). On narrow screens the explainer follows the text.
//   <Section>
//   ## Why doesn't Orion jerk?
//   Text...
//   <div slot="stage"><SmoothVsLinear client:visible /></div>
//   </Section>
---

<section class="lsec">
  <div class="lsec-text"><slot /></div>
  {Astro.slots.has("stage") && <div class="lsec-stage"><slot name="stage" /></div>}
</section>
